message: If you use this software, cite it with the metadata below.
type: software
title: Agrivoltaic garden designer
authors:
  - family-names: Klingelhofer
    given-names: Peter
version: 0.0.0
date-released: '2026-09-12'
repository-code: https://github.com/peterklingelhofer/agrivoltaic-garden-designer
url: https://garden.peterklingelhofer.com
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A planning tool for a vegetable garden and the solar panels above it, together, for a real
  address: it looks up the site's sun, weather and soil, simulates how much light reaches the
  ground once panels are over it, and computes which crops still suit each bed and what to
  plant when.
